[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    187[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // f3 - floored integer division
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    188[0m:[38;5;10m[49m //
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    189[0m:[38;5;10m[49m // Transcribed statement-for-statement, including the comma expressions.  All
